  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nauru Improved Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Nauru Improved Education Partnership supports implementation of Nauru&apos;s Education Sector Strategy to deliver education pathways that develop locally and regionally relevant skills. It has emphasis on: improving quality and increasing the number of teaching staff; improving quality and access to primary and secondary school level education to ensure higher student retention rates and education attainment levels; and improving access to good quality and relevant tertiary, technical and vocational education services.</narrative>
  </description>
